    "notes": "MIT requires the copyright and permission notice to accompany all copies. This provider uses ONE shared notice at .claude/skills/LICENSE rather than a per-skill file, which is why the 23 vendored directories carry none of their own. The vendored file is upstream's MIT text verbatim, preceded by a locally authored SCOPE OF THIS NOTICE header explaining that it covers the mattpocock set only -- .claude/skills/ holds 81 skills from six providers under three different licences. The header is an addition to the notice, not a modification of the MIT terms, so it carries no patch id; upstream_blob_sha pins the upstream half so the update bot can detect licence drift."
